# Drop folder for TradingView Pine chart-data exports used by
# ../tools/compare_fib.py. These CSVs are large, local-only test data —
# never commit them. This file keeps the folder present in the repo.
*.csv

# 🔴 EXCEPT golden/ — the committed exports (a 5m and a 15m file since 2026-09-10), so this gate
#   runs on every clone forever.
# ⚠ golden is REGRESSION (catches the PYTHON drifting), fresh is ACCEPTANCE (catches Pine and
#   Python disagreeing after a Pine edit). A green golden run says NOTHING about a later Pine edit.
!golden/
!golden/*.csv
!golden/*.json
